              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7' bold='true'>EXPOSURES AT RISK</run>
                <run fontcolor='#7a838e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='7'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#16212e' fontname='Arial' fontsize='9'>Exposures whose upstream chain has a failing model, late source, failed refresh or failing test right now. Bars show the count at the end of each day.</run>
              </formatted-text>
